arano</a></dfn>, infielder Zaim Deljianin, and outfielder <dfn><a href=\"/sports/baseball/roster/patrick-sebber/4866\" rel=\"smarttag\" rev=\"4866\">Patrick Sebber</a></dfn> were each named to the Second Team.","type":null,"byline":null,"app_exclusive":false,"sport_display":"Baseball","sport":{"id":1,"title":"Baseball","abbreviation":"BB","shortname":"baseball","short_title":"Baseball","global_sport_id":null,"non_sport":false,"show_at_vs":false,"global_sport_shortname":"baseball","gender":"m","youtube":null,"facebook":null,"twitter":"","instagram":"","pinterest":"","tickets":null,"global_sport_name_slug":null,"url":null,"ranking":null,"game_synonym":null},"sport_shortname":null,"image_source":"/images/2026/3/22/Untitled-2984.jpg","image_focal_point":null,"image_alt_text":"Baseball Season Wrap Up Image","video":null,"url":"/news/2026/5/15/untitled-story.aspx","redirect_absolute_url":null,"links":null,"homepage_feed_template":"story_links","game_id":null,"games":[],"gallery_id":0,"writer":null,"ranking":2,"locked_ranking":false,"id":1089,"content_id":"1089","content_title":"Baseball Season Wrap Up","content_date":"2026-05-15T08:37:00","content_url":"https://nassaulions.com/news/2026/5/15/untitled-story.aspx","content_image_url":"https://nassaulions.com/images/2026/3/22/Untitled-2984.jpg","date":"2026-05-15T08:37:00"},{"title":"Baseball Enters Region XV Tournament","title_in_rotator":true,"sub_headline":null,"teaser":"<p data-end=\"330\" data-start=\"0\">The Nassau Community College baseball team enters the 2026 Region XV Tournament as one of the most dangerous and balanced teams in the field. With a 15-9 overall record, all within conference play, Nassau has battled through a demanding schedule and positioned itself as a legitimate contender for the regional title.","type":null,"byline":null,"app_exclusive":false,"sport_display":"Baseball","sport":{"id":1,"title":"Baseball","abbreviation":"BB","shortname":"baseball","short_title":"Baseball","global_sport_id":null,"non_sport":false,"show_at_vs":false,"global_sport_shortname":"baseball","gender":"m","youtube":null,"facebook":null,"twitter":"","instagram":"","pinterest":"","tickets":null,"global_sport_name_slug":null,"url":null,"ranking":null,"game_synonym":null},"sport_shortname":null,"image_source":"/images/2026/5/5/BasebTournament.jpg","image_focal_point":null,"image_alt_text":"BB","video":null,"url":"/news/2026/5/5/baseball-enters-region-xv-tournament.aspx","redirect_absolute_url":null,"links":null,"homepage_feed_template":"story_links","game_id":null,"games":[],"gallery_id":0,"writer":null,"ranking":3,"locked_ranking":false,"id":1081,"content_id":"1081","content_title":"Baseball Enters Region XV Tournament","content_date":"2026-05-05T15:09:00","content_url":"https://nassaulions.com/news/2026/5/5/baseball-enters-region-xv-tournament.aspx","content_image_url":"https://nassaulions.com/images/2026/5/5/BasebTournament.jpg","date":"2026-05-05T15:09:00"},{"title":"Lions Take Doubleheader at Bronx","title_in_rotator":true,"sub_headline":null,"teaser":"<p data-end=\"369\" data-start=\"59\">Nassau Community College baseball put together a strong all-around day on April 18, sweeping a doubleheader against the Broncos with a 10-7 win in Game 1 and a 7-5 victory in Game 2. Across the two games, the Lions combined for 17 runs and 25 hits while getting key late outs on the mound to complete the sweep. The Lions improve to 10-8 overall and 10-3 in conference play, currently at third place in Region XV.</p>\r\n","type":"postgame","byline":null,"app_exclusive":false,"sport_display":"Baseball","sport":{"id":1,"title":"Baseball","abbreviation":"BB","shortname":"baseball","short_title":"Baseball","global_sport_id":null,"non_sport":false,"show_at_vs":false,"global_sport_shortname":"baseball","gender":"m","youtube":null,"facebook":null,"twitter":"","instagram":"","pinterest":"","tickets":null,"global_sport_name_slug":null,"url":null,"ranking":null,"game_synonym":null},"sport_shortname":null,"image_s